    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>富饶度</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>综合影响地貌、资源、自然奇观、村庄和出生补偿，范围1至10。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Richness</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Controls terrain, resources, wonders, villages and start compensation; range 1-10.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>地图自带道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>沿主大陆海岸和河流预铺道路；默认为古典道路。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Prebuilt Routes</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Places routes along mainland coasts and rivers; defaults to Classical Roads.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_NONE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>无道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_ANCIENT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>远古道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_CLASSICAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>古典道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_INDUSTRIAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>工业道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_MODERN" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>现代道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_ROUTE_RAILROAD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>铁路</Text></Row>
